---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PhotoGallery from '../../../components/PhotoGallery.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { getWintervillaImages } from '../../../lib/galleries.js';
import heroWinter from '../../../images/wintervilla-hero.jpg';

const galleryImages = getWintervillaImages();

const features = [
  'Wood stove & wall heating',
  'Sauna & fitness',
  'High-speed WiFi',
  'Quiet low season',
  'Dogs welcome',
  'Short distances, empty beaches',
];
---

<Layout title="Winter Villa" description="Villa Rosengarten in winter: an icy coastline, warm firelight and quiet on Fehmarn outside the season.">
  <section class="apt-hero">
    <Image
      class="apt-hero-img"
      src={heroWinter}
      alt="Villa Rosengarten in winter, lit up in the snow"
      widths={[800, 1600, 2200]}
      sizes="100vw"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div class="apt-hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Villa Rosengarten</p>
      <h1>The winter villa</h1>
      <p class="apt-hero-sub">When Fehmarn falls quiet – fireside evenings, stormy air and silent beaches.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="apt-section">
      <ul class="feature-list apt-features">
        {features.map((f) => <li>{f}</li>)}
      </ul>

      <p>
        In winter, Fehmarn shows a completely different, equally fascinating
        side: icy stones along the shore, clear air, a low sun over the Baltic
        Sea, and beaches where you’re often alone for as far as the eye can
        see. If you like wind and weather, you’ll find a stillness here that’s
        rare in summer – ideal for long walks with the dog, storm-watching
        from the cliffs, or simply a few days of deliberately doing nothing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Inside the villa itself, things get especially cosy. A wood stove,
        warm wall heating and thick blankets keep you comfortable while the
        wind blows around the house outside. After a walk along the icy
        coast, the villa’s own sauna is just the thing to warm back up – and
        in the evening, the fireplace invites you to linger.
      </p>
      <p>
        The villa is also perfectly suited to longer stays outside the main
        season: professional high-speed WiFi makes it an ideal retreat for
        remote work, while Fehmarn unfolds its winter stillness right outside
        the door. And when snow falls in the evening and the villa glows in
        the warm light of the garden lighting, an atmosphere emerges that
        many of our guests particularly treasure.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {galleryImages.length > 0 && (
    <section class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">Winter impressions</h2>
      <PhotoGallery images={galleryImages} name="Wintervilla" layout="masonry" />
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="booking-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-lg" href="/en/ferienwohnungen/">View apartments</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost-dark" href="/en/kontakt/">Personal inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
